@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state LoggedOut
state ApplicantChoice <<choice, guard: IsAccountCreated?>>
state ApplicationSubmitted
state PaymentMade
state ApplicationAccepted
state StatusViewed
state StatusChecked
state FeedbackGiven
state LoggedIn

[*] --> StartChoice: Create Account / Login
StartChoice --> ApplicantChoice: IsAccountCreated?
ApplicantChoice --> ApplicationSubmitted: Apply for Visa / Check Status / Cancel Application / Modify Details / Give Feedback / Logout [guard: IsLoggedIn]
ApplicationSubmitted --> PaymentMade: Make Payment
PaymentMade --> ApplicationAccepted: Accepted
ApplicationAccepted --> StatusViewed: View Status
StatusViewed --> StatusChecked: Check Status
StatusChecked --> StatusViewed: Back to Status View
StatusViewed --> FeedbackGiven: Give Feedback [guard: IsLoggedIn]
FeedbackGiven --> LoggedIn: Done
LoggedOut --> ApplicantChoice: Login
ApplicationCancelled --> ApplicationSubmitted: Cancel Application [guard: IsLoggedIn]
DetailsModified --> DetailsModified: Modified Details [guard: IsLoggedIn]
LoggedIn --> [*]: Logout [guard: IsLoggedIn]
@enduml
